Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)


HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/temporal/entities/urn:V3
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)


HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
